# The Scale overlay: the rocket Inspector's More menu (the "…" in the header) > "Scale rocket…", with a factor typed in.
#   cargo run -q -p bowshock -- drive --example crates/bowshock/scripts/scale.drive out/scale
viewport 1280x800
click (1255, 62)
screenshot scale-menu.png
click "Scale rocket…"
type "1.5"
screenshot scale-overlay.png
